<title>KENYA: Kenya coffee prices mixed at weekly auction.</title>
<headline>Kenya coffee prices mixed at weekly auction.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenyan coffee auction prices were mixed at the weekly auction in Nairobi, auction officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grades ABs averaged $355 per 50-kg compared to $388 last week while grade AAs averaged $395 from $429.</p>
<p>&quot;Prices were well down except for unwashed buni coffee which held steady,&quot; a trader said.</p>
<p>The Coffee Board of Kenya sold 24,814 60-kg bags of coffee compared to 28,000 sold last week.</p>
<p>--Wambui Chege, Nairobi Newsroom ++254-2 330-261</p>
